# Build context is the repository root; the schild image needs contract/,
# gateway/, dashboard/ (the dashboard is built in the image), go.work.sum and
# the few files of the release tarball. No lab, no relay, no test modules.
*
!go.work.sum
!LICENSE
!contract/
!gateway/
!dashboard/
!docs/ops/systemd/schild.service
!docs/ops/systemd/schild-firewall.service
# The dashboard is built in the ui stage; a local build copy (make ui) never
# enters the image. .gitkeep stays so the embed directory exists.
gateway/internal/webui/dist/*
!gateway/internal/webui/dist/.gitkeep
dashboard/apps/lab-dashboard/src
dashboard/apps/*/dist
dashboard/apps/*/dist-mock
dashboard/apps/*/e2e
dashboard/apps/*/test-results
dashboard/apps/*/playwright-report
**/node_modules
**/*.test
**/coverage.*
**/*.key
# Keys, certificates and env files never enter the build context (the build
# needs none of them; TEST ONLY lab secrets included).
**/*.pem
**/.env
**/.env.*
